Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `open_count` uses the effect `DB.Write`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/sync_query_writes.jet:10:34
    |
 10 | open_count: fn(tasks: DBScope) -[DB.Read]> Int {
    |                                  ^^^^^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[DB.Read]>`, so the body may only use those; `DB.Write` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `DB.Write` to the effect list, or stop using it in `open_count`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: open_count
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
